msgid ""
"关键更新\n"
"--------\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Key Updates\n"
"--------------\n"
""

msgid ""
"- 2026/06/30：新增覆盖四种常用训推后端组合，便于用户在 quickstart 阶段快速选择合适的启动脚本。\n"
"- 2026/05/13：将 quick start 和 install guidance 分开。\n"
"- 2025/12/11：verl 存量场景目前支持自动识别 NPU 设备类型，GPU 脚本在昇腾上运行，原则上不再需要显式设置 ``trainer.device=npu`` 参数，新增特性通过设置 ``trainer.device`` 仍可优先使用，逐步适配自动识别能力。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"- 2026/06/30: Added coverage for four common training and inference backend combinations, making it easier for users to quickly select the appropriate startup script during the quickstart phase.\n"
"- 2026/05/13: Separated the quick start and install guidance.\n"
"- 2025/12/11: Existing verl scenarios now support automatic detection of NPU device types. GPU scripts running on Ascend no longer require explicitly setting the ``trainer.device=npu`` parameter in principle. The new feature can still be prioritized by setting ``trainer.device``, and the automatic detection capability is being gradually adapted.\n"
""

