msgid ""
"本文面向 Ascend NPU 环境，提供基于 GSM8K 和 Qwen3-0.6B 的最小 GRPO 训练验证流程。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"This article provides a minimal GRPO training validation workflow based on GSM8K and Qwen3-0.6B for the Ascend NPU environment.\n"
""

msgid ""
"文档覆盖四种常用训推后端组合，便于用户在 quickstart 阶段快速选择合适的启动脚本。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"The documentation covers four commonly used training and inference backend combinations, making it easier for users to quickly select an appropriate startup script during the quickstart phase.\n"
""

msgid ""
"运行本文脚本前，请确认已完成 verl Ascend 环境安装。\n"
"环境安装详见 `昇腾安装指南 <./install_guidance.rst>`_ 。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Before running the scripts in this document, ensure that you have completed the installation of the verl Ascend environment. For details on environment installation, see the `Ascend Installation Guide <./install_guidance.rst>`_.\n"
""

msgid ""
"A3 每卡含 2 die，A2 每卡 1 die，如果在 A3 机器上跑示例，需要将 ``n_gpus_per_node`` 设置成 16。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"A3 has 2 die per card, while A2 has 1 die per card. If you run the sample on an A3 machine, set ``n_gpus_per_node`` to 16.\n"
""

msgid ""
"四个脚本均默认使用 ``Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B`` 和 GSM8K 数据集进行基础链路验证。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"All four scripts use the ``Qwen/Qwen3-0.6B`` model and the GSM8K dataset by default for basic pipeline validation.\n"
""

msgid ""
"主要用于检查：\n"
""
msgstr ""
"This is mainly used to check:\n"
""

msgid ""
"- verl 入口是否可用；\n"
"- 数据是否可读取；\n"
"- actor、rollout、reference worker 是否能初始化；\n"
"- vLLM-Ascend/sglang rollout 是否能生成；\n"
"- 训练链路是否能完成首个 step。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"- Whether the verl entry point is available;\n"
"- Whether the data can be read;\n"
"- Whether the actor, rollout, and reference workers can initialize;\n"
"- Whether the vLLM-Ascend/sglang rollout can generate;\n"
"- Whether the training pipeline can complete the first step.\n"
""

