msgid ""
"SGLang 后端使能说明\n"
"-------------------------------------------\n"
""
msgstr ""
"SGLang Backend Enablement Guide\n"
"-------------------------------------------\n"
""

msgid ""
"当前 verl 已解析推理常见参数，详见 `async_sglang_server.py <../../../../verl/workers/rollout/sglang_rollout/async_sglang_server.py>`_ 中 ``ServerArgs`` 初始化传参。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Currently, verl has parsed common inference parameters. For details, see the ``ServerArgs`` initialization arguments in `async_sglang_server.py <../../../../verl/workers/rollout/sglang_rollout/async_sglang_server.py>`_.\n"
""

msgid ""
"其他 `SGLang 参数 <https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/v0.5.10/docs/advanced_features/server_arguments.md>`_ 均可通过 ``engine_kwargs`` 进行参数传递。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Other `SGLang parameters <https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/v0.5.10/docs/advanced_features/server_arguments.md>`_ can be passed through ``engine_kwargs``.\n"
""

msgid ""
"vLLM 后端脚本转换为 SGLang\n"
"~~~~~~~~\n"
""
msgstr ""
"vLLM Backend Script Conversion to SGLang\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
""

msgid ""
"如需自行将 vLLM 后端推理脚本转换为 SGLang，需要添加或修改以下参数。\n"
""
msgstr ""
"If you need to convert the vLLM backend inference script to SGLang yourself, add or modify the following parameters.\n"
""

msgid ""
"   # 必须\n"
"   actor_rollout_ref.rollout.name=sglang \\\n"
"   +actor_rollout_ref.rollout.engine_kwargs.sglang.attention_backend=\"ascend\" \\\n"
""
msgstr ""
"# Required\n"
"actor_rollout_ref.rollout.name=sglang \\\n"
"+actor_rollout_ref.rollout.engine_kwargs.sglang.attention_backend=\"ascend\" \\\n"
""

msgid ""
"   # 可选\n"
"   # 使能推理 EP，详细使用方法见：\n"
"   # https://github.com/sgl-project/sgl-kernel-npu/blob/main/python/deep_ep/README_CN.md\n"
"   ++actor_rollout_ref.rollout.engine_kwargs.sglang.deepep_mode=\"auto\" \\\n"
"   ++actor_rollout_ref.rollout.engine_kwargs.sglang.moe_a2a_backend=\"deepep\" \\\n"
""
msgstr ""
"# Optional\n"
"# Enable the inference EP. For detailed usage, see:\n"
"# https://github.com/sgl-project/sgl-kernel-npu/blob/main/python/deep_ep/README_CN.md\n"
"++actor_rollout_ref.rollout.engine_kwargs.sglang.deepep_mode=\"auto\" \\\n"
"++actor_rollout_ref.rollout.engine_kwargs.sglang.moe_a2a_backend=\"deepep\" \\\n"
""

msgid ""
"   # MoE 模型多 DP 时必须设置为 True\n"
"   +actor_rollout_ref.rollout.engine_kwargs.sglang.enable_dp_attention=False \\\n"
""
msgstr ""
"# Must be set to True when the MoE model uses multiple DP\n"
"+actor_rollout_ref.rollout.engine_kwargs.sglang.enable_dp_attention=False \\\n"
""

msgid ""
"   # chunked_prefill 默认关闭\n"
"   +actor_rollout_ref.rollout.engine_kwargs.sglang.chunked_prefill_size=-1\n"
""
msgstr ""
"# chunked_prefill is disabled by default\n"
"+actor_rollout_ref.rollout.engine_kwargs.sglang.chunked_prefill_size=-1\n"
""
